<section class="kube-start-section" aria-labelledby="learning-path-title">
  <div class="kube-section-container">
    <div class="kube-home-section-heading">
      <div><p class="kube-label">Less searching. More learning.</p><h2 id="learning-path-title">A clear path through cloud native.</h2></div>
      <p>New to containers? Begin with Docker. Already comfortable? Jump into the topic you need. Every guide is free and self-paced.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kube-learning-grid">
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/Learn-Docker/"><span class="kube-learning-step">01 · Start here</span><h3>Build with Docker</h3><p>Understand images and containers before moving to orchestration.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open Docker guide →</span></a>
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/Learn-k8s/"><span class="kube-learning-step">02 · Orchestrate</span><h3>Think in Kubernetes</h3><p>Connect cluster architecture, workloads, and networking concepts.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open Kubernetes guide →</span></a>
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/Learn-Helm/"><span class="kube-learning-step">03 · Package</span><h3>Ship with Helm</h3><p>Explore charts and configuration for repeatable application releases.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open Helm guide →</span></a>
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/Learn-Containerd/"><span class="kube-learning-step">04 · Go deeper</span><h3>Meet the runtime</h3><p>See where containerd fits beneath your container tooling.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open containerd guide →</span></a>
    </div>
    <form class="kube-home-search" action="/tools/" method="get" role="search" aria-label="Search the tool directory">
      <label for="home-tool-search">Looking for a tool instead?</label>
      <div><input id="home-tool-search" type="search" name="q" placeholder="Search GitOps, monitoring, containers…"/><button class="kube-button" type="submit">Find tools →</button></div>
      <p>A curated directory, with filters you can bookmark and share.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

